#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:6
msgid "Touch LCD Shield"
msgstr "Touch LCD Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Touch LCD Shield gives the OpenMV Cam a 2.3 inch 320x240 capacitive "
"multi-touch display so you can preview the camera output (and accept input) "
"without a host computer. Two Qwiic headers make it easy to chain extra I2C "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Touch LCD Shield 為 OpenMV Cam 提供一塊 2.3 吋 320x240 "
"的電容式多點觸控顯示器，讓你不必透過主機電腦即可預覽相機輸出（並接受輸入）。兩個 Qwiic 接頭讓你能輕鬆串接額外的 I2C 裝置。"

