"page <https://openmv.io/products/touch-lcd-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"完整的資料表、照片與訂購資訊，請參閱 `Touch LCD Shield 產品頁面 <https://openmv.io/products/touch-"
"lcd-shield>`_\\ 。"

